# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=spirv-tools
_lockname=spirv-tools
pkgver=2025.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="SPIR-V tools: assembler, validator, optimizer"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Tools"
license=(Apache-2.0)
depends=(glibc gcc-libs)
source=("https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Tools/archive/v$pkgver/SPIRV-Tools-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('4a6147f9cb00ca33adedeb717c4b397480cd7f7f3128ac24dee8c24b6145ecf3')

build() {
    cmake -S SPIRV-Tools-$pkgver -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DSPIRV-Headers_SOURCE_DIR=/usr \
        -DSPIRV_TOOLS_BUILD_STATIC=OFF -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \
        -DSPIRV_WERROR=OFF -DSPIRV_SKIP_TESTS=ON
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
